<td id="S1.T1.1.1.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left"><cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib35" title="" class="ltx_ref">Liu et al., 2025</a>)</cite></td>
<td id="S1.T1.1.1.5.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">●</td>
